  "simplelights.guide.page.3.title": "Light Panes",
  "simplelights.guide.page.3": "A flat lamp panel, 1 px thick like an item frame, that sticks to any side of a block:",
  "simplelights.guide.page.4.title": "Light Panes",
  "simplelights.guide.page.4": "plain, transparent, in the 16 dye colors, a redstone version whose color follows the signal strength, and a copper version that toggles with every redstone pulse.",
  "simplelights.guide.page.5.title": "Moved from SimpleBuilding",
  "simplelights.guide.page.5": "The 37 Light Panes, their recipes and recipe unlocks were SimpleBuilding's (simplebuilding:*). Old worlds load them under simplelights:* through SimpleLib's id moves and save the new ids;",
