  "simplelights.guide.page.7.title": "Creative tabs",
  "simplelights.guide.page.7": "Own tab with the 37 panes and the guide. Without SimpleBuilding the panes also sit behind the redstone lamp in the Vanilla functional blocks tab (switch addItemsToVanillaTabs); with SimpleBuilding its tabs list them in their old places.",
